#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_Tanimura"
msgid "Hey, you."
msgstr "Oye, tú."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Suspect"
msgid "Huh? Whaddya want?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Qué quieres?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Tanimura"
msgid "I'm with the police. You were involved in a robbery,\\r\nweren't you? I'm placing you under arrest."
msgstr "Estoy con la policía. Estuviste involucrado en un robo,\\r\n¿No es así? Te pondré bajo arresto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Suspect"
msgid "Whaaaat? Me? You must be mistaken, officer－I haven't robbed\\r\na soul. Just look at these innocent eyes!"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¿Yo? Debe estar equivocado, oficial. Yo no he robado\\r\nni a un alma. ¡Solo mira estos ojos inocentes!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Tanimura"
msgid "(He's denying it, but his face and jacket are exactly what the artist described. Maybe I should press him a little further.)"
msgstr "(Él lo niega, pero su cara y su chaqueta son exactamente lo que el artista\\r\ndescribió. Tal vez debería presionarlo un poco más)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Tanimura"
msgid "Yeah? Then if what you're saying is true, show me what's\\r\ninside that jacket."
msgstr "¿Sí? Entonces, si lo que estás diciendo es cierto, muéstrame lo que hay\\r\ndentro de tu chaqueta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Tanimura"
msgid "Shouldn't be a big deal... Unless, of course, you have done something suspicious."
msgstr "No debería ser un gran problema... A menos, por supuesto, que hayas hecho\\r\nalgo sospechoso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Suspect"
msgid "You... wanna peek inside the jacket, huh..."
msgstr "Tú... Quiero echar un vistazo dentro de mi chaqueta, eh..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Culprit"
msgid "Dammit! How'd you know it was me!? I was sure nobody saw my face..."
msgstr "¡Maldita sea! ¡¿Cómo supiste que era yo?! Estaba seguro de que nadie me había visto la cara..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Tanimura"
msgid "Yeah, well, maybe you weren't as careful as you thought.\\r\nNow I suggest you come along quietly."
msgstr "Sí, bueno, tal vez no fuiste tan cuidadoso como pensabas.\\r\nAhora te sugiero que vengas en silencio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Culprit"
msgid "Damn... We went to all that trouble fighting the yakuza to get those weapons! No way in hell we're gonna get busted before we even use 'em!"
msgstr "Maldito... ¡Nos tomamos la molestia de luchar contra la yakuza para conseguir\\r\nesas armas! ¡De ninguna manera nos van a arrestar antes de que las usemos!"

